        "sentence_id": "ec63254628cf8a161655b9e7240e447a",
        "sentence_text": " The UK since then has gone through significant change to its system of government, with devolved parliaments, assemblies and governments in Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 33,
        "source_order": [
          0,
          0,
