        "query_id": "5a8eed625542995085b374b9",
        "sentence_id": "c16bfb65917424deb679ff4a8992ada0",
        "sentence_text": " England, however, remains under the full jurisdiction, on all matters, of the Parliament of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Northern Ireland and the UK government as no devolved administration has been created for England within the new structure.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 46,
        "source_order": [
