        "sentence_id": "e305fc7cef662c8cef6e63975c3b5790",
        "sentence_text": " This situation has led to the anomaly, known as the West Lothian question, which is that Scottish Members of Parliament (MPs) are able to vote on legislation that affects only England whereas English MPs can not vote on certain Scottish matters due to devolution.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 53,
        "source_order": [
