        "sentence_id": "544b1ef33c0b6c1b776a25b096d34d6b",
        "sentence_text": " As is typical of all Canadian provinces, and Westminster systems more generally, Alberta's is an unwritten constitution.",
        "sentence_token_cost": 22,
