        "sentence_id": "bd45b1fe9ec266a059d12a3a5e7f7407",
        "sentence_text": " Alberta's constitution, like Britain's (on which it is modeled), includes any and all pieces of legislation, court decisions, proclamations, and conventions which together inform how the province operates.",
