        "sentence_id": "2d33045901bee63882effa6496bcf869",
        "sentence_text": " The Australian Public Service was established at the Federation of Australia in 1901 as the Commonwealth Public Service and modeled on the Westminster system and United Kingdom's Civil Service.",
