        "sentence_id": "fdef88bbc3d8f6195854e0c08dcc2494",
        "sentence_text": " Thus, linear units such as the furlong and mile, which were defined in terms of perches, were longer by a factor of 14:11 (~27% more) in Irish measure, while areas such as the rood or acre were larger by 196:121 (~62% more).",
        "sentence_token_cost": 70,
