        "sentence_id": "cb0b0be19477ad31c5b039bb70330b9b",
        "sentence_text": " Later, with Confederation in 1867, the British maritime colonies of New Brunswick and Nova Scotia were joined with the British colony of Canada to form the Dominion of Canada, which was subsequently divided into four provinces, Ontario, Quebec, New Brunswick, and Nova Scotia.",
