        "sentence_id": "309432b92155f105b7d0e1c5ea322bfe",
        "sentence_text": " Over time, the remaining colonies and territories within British North America came under the control of Canada until the current geographic extent of the country was reached when Newfoundland and Labrador joined Canada in 1949.",
